      "title": "Dark Storm Team: Operations, Alliances and DDoS-for-Hire Services",
      "summary": "Dark Storm Team is a hacktivist group first observed in late 2023 that gained attention after claiming a large outage of X in March 2025. Its operator, using the persona GLITCH, repeatedly rebuilt its Telegram and X presence after platform bans, often with help from allied groups such as Team1914. The group publishes claims against government, financial, transport, and platform targets across many countries, usually with Check-Host screenshots as proof, though the evidence often does not confirm the impact claimed. Dark Storm also sells DDoS services and other offerings, including database dumps and account access, with payment in cryptocurrency only. The report's takeaway is that Telegram claims and alliance announcements alone do not establish attack impact, operator identity, or operational partnership.",
